{"title":"Tome Toolsmithing Gold","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Butcher, Ogre Charger, Ogre Mauler, Bogling, Gaunt Ogre +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 12 of 823 looted corpses (1/69)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/69<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 6 of 494 looted corpses (1/82)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/82<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 9 of 1,397 looted corpses (1/155)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/155<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - dropped it in 1 of 283 looted corpses (1/283)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/283<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 3 of 854 looted corpses (1/285)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/285<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - dropped it in 2 of 1,171 looted corpses (1/586)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/586<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"tome-toolsmithing-gold\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/441d285c7eef80191cc6.svg\" alt=\"Tome Toolsmithing Gold\"></div><h3>Tome Toolsmithing Gold</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 8:12:49 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}